# Research experiments are archived on the `codex/collaboration` branch rather
# than merged into main. They have no product dependency: nothing under Code/
# imports them, and packaging only collects Code/src. Retrieve them with:
#   git checkout origin/codex/collaboration -- experiments/
# Remove this rule if experiments should become part of the main tree again.
/experiments/
